{"id":"vod_sn_38786","vodId":"38786","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"三者三叶","name_cn":"三者三叶","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/9906e5ed368a35d6d3706cad69abbf15.jpg"},"summary":"西川叶子（和久井优 配音）曾是衔着金汤匙出生的千金大小姐，过得是锦衣玉食的富足生活。然而某一日，父亲的公司破产倒闭，叶子不得不开始学习如何去过庶民过的那种生活。不过最近，她已经渐渐开始习惯她的庶民生活了，甚至从中找到了乐趣。　　小田切双叶（金泽舞 配音）个性活泼开朗，有着超级旺盛的食欲的她曾经在数家店面里创下过大胃王挑战的记录，双叶不仅仅爱吃，在烹饪上也是一把好手。叶山照（今村彩夏 配音）表面看似成绩优异的乖乖女，实际上却有着非常腹黑的一面，每一天都在扮演着好学生的角色。这三个名字里都有“叶”的女孩成为了朋友。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:04:36","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/g8jM8gdhZc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RwQW42Yd5R1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/NQp0p5vCP71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/x3KxC0eVqY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LAP91neitz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/NXbBSY1kVj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/A80pcMuSTR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kFShJsApx51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TgaLKfzDCU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JwqRBzTA6Y1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1t1vcDT1F51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1JHFYLyGKQ1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:54.685Z"}